# Tuned for the MULTI-STAGE Dockerfile at the repo root, which compiles the
# monorepo INSIDE the image.
#
# The variant create-app ships is tuned for the host-build flow it also ships,
# and excludes `packages/*/src` and `plugins` outright — correct when the image
# only ever copies packages/backend/dist, but fatal here: `yarn tsc` would have
# no source to compile. Keep this file in sync with the root Dockerfile, not
# with upstream's.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz
packages/*/dist
packages/*/dist-types
*.local.yaml
